@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    Your privacy is important to us. This website does not collect any personal data unless you voluntarily provide it through contact forms or newsletter subscriptions. Any information you submit will only be used to respond to your inquiries or provide the requested service.

    We do not share your information with third parties, except as required by law. Basic analytics may be collected (such as browser type or pages visited) to improve the site, but this data is anonymized and cannot be used to identify you.

    By using this website, you consent to this privacy policy. For any questions, please contact us via the contact page.
</p>

<button id="printButton" onclick="window.print()">🖨️ Print this page</button>
